          <div class="divider"></div>
        </div>
        <p>Mad Quest Studio is an independent game development studio based in Canberra, Australia, dedicated to crafting handcrafted games with soul.</p>
        <p>We build games we'd want to play — weird, atmospheric, and full of character. From farm-protection nights to ancient mysteries, our projects share a love of strong mechanics wrapped in distinctive style.</p>
